msgid ""
"Raises ValueError for invalid GPIO arguments or a partially configured IRQ pair; OSError on "
"failed I2C configuration and RuntimeError if host Pin support is unavailable for IRQ. With IRQ "
"enabled, construction configures the module output and Basic falling-edge input."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 参数无效或只配置一个 IRQ 引脚时抛出 ValueError；I2C 配置失败时抛出 OSError；IRQ 所需主控 Pin 支持不可用时抛出 RuntimeError。启用 "
"IRQ 的构造过程会配置模块输出和 Basic 下降沿输入。"

#: ../../../home/loki/uiflow_workspace/uiflow-stp2-rebase/docs/source/stamp/stp2.rst:269
msgid ""
"For callbacks, replace the final line with the following construction; do not keep two active "
