msgid ""
"Callbacks run in scheduled MicroPython context. Each triggered bit produces one Event with "
"target, code and user_data. code contains one EVENT flag. Calling without an IRQ pair raises "
"RuntimeError; remove callbacks by their returned handle."
msgstr ""
"回调在 MicroPython 调度上下文执行。每个触发位产生一个含 target、code、user_data 的 Event，code 为单个 EVENT 标志。未配置 IRQ "
"引脚对时调用会抛出 RuntimeError；使用返回的句柄注销回调。"

