msgstr "此操作可重复调用，普通寄存器访问仍可使用；已配置 IRQ 引脚时，add_event_cb() 可重新创建中断注册。"

#: ../../../home/loki/uiflow_workspace/uiflow-stp2-rebase/docs/source/stamp/stp2.rst:528
msgid ""
"Wake StampTimerPower2 and wait for communication to recover. The driver sends an empty I2C "
"transaction and ignores a NACK from the first wake attempt."
