#: ../../../home/loki/uiflow_workspace/uiflow-stp2-rebase/docs/source/stamp/stp2.rst:2413
msgid ""
"Shared frequency in the range ``1~65535`` Hz; ``None`` preserves it, falling back to 500 Hz when "
"the frequency register is zero."
msgstr "共享频率范围为  ``1~65535``  Hz； ``None``  保持当前频率，寄存器为零时使用 500 Hz。"

msgid "MicroPython Code Block:"
msgstr "MicroPython 代码块："

msgid "Example output:"
msgstr "示例输出："

msgid "**API**"
msgstr "**API**"

msgid "Module IRQ output GPIO, 0~4; -1 disables IRQ. Default: -1. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "模块 IRQ 输出 GPIO，范围 0~4；-1 表示不启用。 默认值：-1。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid ""
"Basic IRQ input GPIO; use 26 for this wiring, or -1 without IRQ. Default: -1. Keyword-only "
"parameter."
msgstr "Basic IRQ 输入 GPIO，本示例接线使用 26；不用 IRQ 时为 -1。 默认值：-1。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Application data exposed as ``event.user_data``. Default: ``None``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "随事件原样提供给回调的数据。 默认值：``None``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Invalid argument type."
msgstr "参数类型无效。"

msgid "Invalid argument value."
msgstr "参数值无效。"

msgid "No return value."
msgstr "无返回值。"

msgid ""
"``Pin.IN``, ``Pin.OUT``, or ``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN``; ``None`` preserves the current mode. Default: "
"``None``."
msgstr "使用 ``Pin.IN`` 、 ``Pin.OUT`` 或 ``Pin.OPEN_DRAIN`` ； ``None`` 保持当前模式。 默认值：``None``。"

msgid ""
"``Pin.PULL_UP``, ``Pin.PULL_DOWN``, or ``None``; ``-1`` preserves the current setting. Default: "
"``-1``."
msgstr "使用 ``Pin.PULL_UP`` 、 ``Pin.PULL_DOWN`` 或 ``None`` ； ``-1`` 保持当前配置。 默认值：``-1``。"

msgid ""
"Initial output level; ``None`` leaves the output latch unchanged. Default: ``None``. Keyword-only"
" parameter."
msgstr "初始输出电平，支持 ``0`` 、 ``1`` 、 ``False`` 或 ``True`` ； ``None`` 不写输出。 默认值：``None``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid ""
"Shared frequency in the range ``1~65535`` Hz; ``None`` preserves it, falling back to 500 Hz when "
"the frequency register is zero. Default: ``None``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "共享频率范围为  ``1~65535``  Hz； ``None``  保持当前频率，寄存器为零时使用 500 Hz。 默认值：``None``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Initial duty in the range ``0~65535``. Default: ``0``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "16 位占空比，范围 ``0~65535`` 。 默认值：``0``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid ""
"Initial high pulse width in nanoseconds; mutually exclusive with nonzero ``duty_u16``. Default: "
"``None``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "高电平脉宽，单位 ns； ``None`` 表示不设置。 默认值：``None``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "``True`` selects inverted output polarity. Default: ``False``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "是否反相输出极性。 默认值：``False``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Bytes per pixel; only RGB value ``3`` is supported. Default: ``3``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "每像素字节数；StampTimerPower2 仅支持 RGB，即 ``3`` 。 默认值：``3``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid ""
"NeoPixel protocol timing selector, ``0`` or ``1``; StampTimerPower2 uses fixed hardware timing "
"for both. Default: ``1``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "NeoPixel 协议时序选择值，可用 ``0`` 或 ``1`` ；两者均由 StampTimerPower2 使用固定硬件时序输出。 默认值：``1``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Operation failed."
msgstr "操作失败。"

msgid "Clear the wake-source flags returned by this read. Default: ``False``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "是否清除本次读取到的唤醒来源位。 默认值：``False``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Wake-source bits to clear; ``None`` clears every valid wake-source bit. Default: ``None``."
msgstr "要操作的状态位掩码。 默认值：``None``。"

msgid "Refresh the LED output after writing. Default: ``True``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "写入后是否立即刷新 LED 输出。 默认值：``True``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Refresh the LED output after clearing. Default: ``True``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "写入后是否立即刷新 LED 输出。 默认值：``True``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Execute the configured pulse output immediately. Default: ``True``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "配置后是否立即执行脉冲输出。 默认值：``True``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Clear the flags returned by this read. Default: ``False``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "是否清除本次读取到的状态位。 默认值：``False``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Group-local status bits to clear; ``None`` clears every valid bit in the group. Default: ``None``."
msgstr "要操作的状态位掩码。 默认值：``None``。"

msgid "Byte offset in the range 0~31; offset + length must not exceed 32. Default: ``0``."
msgstr "字节偏移范围为 0~31；offset + length 不得超过 32。 默认值：``0``。"

msgid "Number of bytes to read; ``offset + length`` must not exceed ``32``. Default: ``32``."
msgstr "读取长度，且 ``offset + length`` 不得超过 32。 默认值：``32``。"

msgid ""
"Output level; ``None`` reads, while ``0``, ``1``, ``False``, or ``True`` writes. Default: "
"``None``."
msgstr "输出电平； ``None`` 表示读取，写入支持 ``0`` 、 ``1`` 、 ``False`` 或 ``True`` 。 默认值：``None``。"

msgid "The object is not in a valid state."
msgstr "对象当前状态不允许此操作。"

msgid "Duty in the range ``0~65535``; ``None`` preserves it. Default: ``None``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "16 位占空比，范围 ``0~65535`` 。 默认值：``None``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid ""
"High pulse width in nanoseconds; mutually exclusive with ``duty_u16``. Default: ``None``. "
"Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "高电平脉宽，单位 ns； ``None`` 表示不设置。 默认值：``None``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Output polarity; ``None`` preserves it. Default: ``None``. Keyword-only parameter."
msgstr "是否反相输出极性。 默认值：``None``。 仅限关键字参数。"

msgid "Shared frequency in the range ``1~65535`` Hz; ``None`` reads it. Default: ``None``."
msgstr "PWM 频率，范围 ``1~65535`` Hz； ``None`` 表示读取。 默认值：``None``。"

msgid "Duty in the range ``0~65535``; ``None`` reads it. Default: ``None``."
msgstr "16 位占空比，范围 ``0~65535`` ； ``None`` 表示读取。 默认值：``None``。"

msgid ""
"High pulse width in nanoseconds; ``None`` reads it. The value cannot exceed the current PWM "
"period. Default: ``None``."
msgstr "高电平脉宽，单位 ns； ``None`` 表示读取。设置值不得超过当前 PWM 周期。 默认值：``None``。"

msgid ""
"``True`` selects inverted polarity, ``False`` selects normal polarity, and ``None`` reads it. "
"Default: ``None``."
msgstr "``True`` 表示反相； ``False`` 表示正常极性； ``None`` 表示读取。 默认值：``None``。"

msgid ""
"Run each file independently on Basic. A/C selects a test and B starts it. During a test, B stops "
"and releases resources; A/C changes the parameter shown on screen. The screen shows wiring, mode,"
" live values and errors. Power actions require ENABLE_POWER_ACTIONS = True and a second B "
"confirmation. Hardware verification is pending."
msgstr ""
"各文件在 Basic 上独立运行。菜单中 A/C 选择测试、B 启动；运行时 B 停止并释放资源，A/C 调整屏幕提示的参数。屏幕显示接线、模式、实时数值和异常。电源动作需手动设置 "
"ENABLE_POWER_ACTIONS = True，再次按 B 确认。实机状态：未验证。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Identity / power source, Unique ID, Voltage monitor. Read "
"the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "通过按键切换设备信息、UID 和电压监视；屏幕数值随模块供电变化。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Read power configuration, Charging control, DCDC control, "
"LDO control, Boost control. Read the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "默认读取配置；充电及各电源轨控制需手动解锁。运行时 A 关闭/C 开启，屏幕读回并在停止时恢复进入测试前状态。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Direct input G4, Pin input G4, Direct push-pull G3, Pin "
"push-pull G3, Direct open-drain G3, Pin open-drain G3. Read the current test values on screen; "
"press B to stop."
msgstr "A/C 控制输出低/高电平，输入模式显示实时电平。直接接口与 Pin 封装分别可选。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Direct ADC G1, Direct ADC G2, ADC wrapper G1, ADC wrapper "
"G2, Internal ADC. Read the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "直接接口/ADC 封装分别采样 G1/G2；屏幕显示通道、原始值、毫伏/微伏和参考电压。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Direct PWM0 1kHz, Direct PWM1 1kHz, Wrapper PWM0 1kHz, "
"Wrapper PWM1 1kHz, Direct PWM0 5kHz, Wrapper PWM0 1kHz INV. Read the current test values on "
"screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "启动后 A/C 以 10% 步进调整占空比；分别提供 1kHz/5kHz 和反相场景，屏幕显示设置和读回值。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Direct RGB / 1 LED, Wrapper RGB / 1 LED, Wrapper RGB / 4 "
"LEDs. Read the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "A/C 选择红绿蓝白/关闭，屏幕显示模式、数量和 RGB，停止时熄灭并释放输出。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Communication, Gain mode, Pulse count. Read the current test"
" values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "默认只检查通信；输出测试用 A/C 手动选择模式或脉冲数，按键变更才触发一次。屏幕不将命令成功当作声音验收。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: G4 single IRQ, G2 + G3 IRQ. Read the current test values on "
"screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "屏幕分别显示 IRQ 计数、最后事件和实时输入电平。停止时注销回调、释放 G26 IRQ 并恢复输入上拉位。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Poll button, Button INT callbacks. Read the current test "
"values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "屏幕显示 STP2 按钮电平、单击/双击事件及计数，Basic B 停止。回调测试才创建 G26。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Read wake source, Configure G4 wake, LDO shutdown + G4 wake."
" Read the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "先读唤醒来源，选配置测试可启用 G4 Wake 并停止清理；关机唤醒测试解锁后倒计时，观察 LDO 断电及接地恢复，不是 Basic 整机唤醒。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Read RTC pages, Temporary pattern. Read the current test "
"values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "屏幕显示地址、测试字节和读回比较。A/C 切换 0x55/0xAA/递增/全零图案，B 停止恢复。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Flag timer / 5 s, Clear timer, Timer reboot, Timer off, "
"Timer on. Read the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "屏幕显示软件倒计时及模块 IRQ 标志；标志测试结束清除定时器，电源动作执行后由用户观察模块供电。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Read watchdog, Feed / expire test. Read the current test "
"values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "默认只读取剩余秒数。主动测试启动 10 秒看门狗，屏幕显示喂狗/停止喂狗、计数和剩余时间；A 停止喂狗，C 恢复，B 禁用。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Read configuration, Set idle timeout, Idle then wake. Read "
"the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "读取页显示模块频率和超时；A/C 修改睡眠秒数；休眠测试显示等待倒计时、唤醒和通信结果。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Communication, Reboot, Power off, Download, Defaults. Read "
"the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "默认检查通信；选定命令后屏幕先给出确认提示，执行后停留在命令已发送页面，不继续访问模块。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Read registers, Temporary u16 write. Read the current test "
"values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "屏幕显示 8/16 位寄存器读值；临时写入测试 A/C 修改数值并读回，停止时恢复。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。"

msgid "UiFlow2 Code Block:"
msgstr "UiFlow2 图形代码块："

msgid "Invalid GPIO arguments or an incomplete IRQ pair."
msgstr "GPIO 参数无效，或 IRQ 引脚未成对配置。"

msgid "I2C communication failed."
msgstr "I2C 通信失败。"

msgid "Host IRQ support is unavailable."
msgstr "主机不支持所需的 IRQ 功能。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Direct input G4, Pin input G4, Direct push-pull G3, Pin "
"push-pull G3, Direct open-drain G3, Pin open-drain G3, Wrapper lifecycle. Read the current test "
"values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "A/C 控制输出低/高电平，输入模式显示实时电平。直接接口与 Pin 封装分别可选。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。 另有封装生命周期测试，A/C 手动执行释放与重新初始化。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Direct ADC G1, Direct ADC G2, ADC wrapper G1, ADC wrapper "
"G2, Internal ADC, Wrapper lifecycle. Read the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "直接接口/ADC 封装分别采样 G1/G2；屏幕显示通道、原始值、毫伏/微伏和参考电压。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。 另有封装生命周期测试，A/C 手动执行释放与重新初始化。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Direct PWM0 1kHz, Direct PWM1 1kHz, Wrapper PWM0 1kHz, "
"Wrapper PWM1 1kHz, Direct PWM0 5kHz, Wrapper PWM0 1kHz INV, Wrapper lifecycle. Read the current "
"test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr ""
"启动后 A/C 以 10% 步进调整占空比；分别提供 1kHz/5kHz 和反相场景，屏幕显示设置和读回值。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。 另有封装生命周期测试，A/C "
"手动执行释放与重新初始化。"

msgid ""
"Use the Basic button menu to select: Direct RGB / 1 LED, Wrapper RGB / 1 LED, Wrapper RGB / 4 "
"LEDs, Wrapper lifecycle. Read the current test values on screen; press B to stop."
msgstr "A/C 选择红绿蓝白/关闭，屏幕显示模式、数量和 RGB，停止时熄灭并释放输出。 菜单中使用 A/C 选择测试、B 启动或停止。 另有封装生命周期测试，A/C 手动执行释放与重新初始化。"

msgid "None"
msgstr "None"

msgid "System configuration"
msgstr "系统配置"

msgid "Display G4 input and G3 level immediately on a black background. A sets G3 low; C sets it high. B switches G3 between input and output, setting the pin to input and preloading low before enabling output. Values are also printed to the serial console."
msgstr "黑底实时显示 G4 输入和 G3 电平。A 将 G3 置低，C 置高，B 切换 G3 输入/输出；启用输出前先置为输入并预写低电平。串口同步输出电平。"

msgid "Display the raw ADC values (0..4095) from G1 and G2 immediately on a black background. Both values are updated every 200 ms and printed to the serial console. No button operation is required."
msgstr "黑底直接显示 G1、G2 的 ADC 原始值（0..4095），每 200 ms 更新并同步输出串口，无需按键启动。"

msgid "Control external RGB LEDs on G0. A cycles red, green, blue and white; B decreases brightness by 10%; C increases it by 10%. Brightness ranges from 0% (off) to 100%. The black screen shows only color, brightness and button hints. Set LED_COUNT to match the connected strip."
msgstr "控制 G0 外接 RGB 灯珠。A 切换红绿蓝白，B 降低 10% 亮度，C 提高 10%；范围 0%（熄灯）至 100%。黑底只显示颜色、亮度和按键提示。LED_COUNT 按实际灯珠数量设置。"

msgid "G4 input: connect to GND / release. Reads automatically; no button needed."
msgstr "GPIO 输入：G4 上拉输入，接地显示 LOW (0)，松开显示 HIGH (1)，自动刷新，无需按键。"

msgid "G3 output: meter or resistor + LED. A/B/C only control G3 output."
msgstr "GPIO 输出：仅控制 G3。A 置低，B 翻转，C 置高；分别显示输出设定和引脚实际读回值。"

msgid "G3: select input or output explicitly. Output starts only after level is set."
msgstr "GPIO 安全切换：仅操作 G3。A 切输入，B 切低电平输出，C 切高电平输出。切输出前先处于输入模式，写入目标电平后再启用输出；先断开外部强驱动。"

msgid "G1 / G2: analog signals to module GND. Input: 0..Vref; never connect 5V."
msgstr "ADC 输入：自动显示 G1、G2 的 ADC 原始数值（0..4095），不换算电压。"

msgid "RGB LED DIN -> G0; shared GND. A changes color; B/C change brightness."
msgstr "NeoPixel：灯珠 DIN 接 G0 并共地。A 切换红/绿/蓝/白，B 亮度减 10%，C 加 10%；LED_COUNT 按实际灯珠数填写。"

msgid "PWM0 / G3 -> oscilloscope or LED. A/C change duty; B sets duty to zero."
msgstr "PWM 输出：PWM0 对应 G3。A 占空比减 10%，B 置零，C 加 10%，范围 0..100%；显示共享频率。"

msgid "Read STP2 identity and battery voltage. Automatic readout; no button needed."
msgstr "设备信息：自动显示固件/硬件版本和电池电压（mV）。"

msgid "AW8737A control -> G3; audio required. Select gain mode, then press B to send."
msgstr "功放控制：AW8737A 控制线接 G3。A/C 选择 0..3 模式，B 才发送；分别显示待发送和上次已发送的模式。"

msgid "Adjust STP2 I2C idle sleep timeout. B restores timeout captured at startup."
msgstr "I2C 配置：A/C 将空闲休眠超时减/加 1 秒，B 恢复启动时值；0 表示禁用。持续轮询仅演示配置读写，不验证进入休眠。"

msgid "Write patterns to RTC bytes 24..31. B restores the original eight bytes."
msgstr "RTC RAM：显示字节 24..31。A 写入 55，C 写入 AA，B 恢复启动时保存的八个字节；退出前按 B。"

msgid "Read/write one RTC RAM word. B restores the startup value."
msgstr "寄存器：仅操作 RTC RAM 的 0xBE/0xBF 字。A 减 1，C 加 1，B 恢复启动值；按十六进制显示读回值，退出前按 B。"

msgid "Start a 5-second flag-only timer. No reboot or power switching."
msgstr "定时器：A 启动 5 秒置标志定时器，B 取消；分别显示主机倒计时和实际系统 IRQ 原始标志，不进行电源切换。"

msgid "G4 falling-edge wake configuration. Enable first, then pull G4 to GND."
msgstr "GPIO 唤醒配置：G4 下降沿。A 启用，B 禁用；显示配置与唤醒源原始值。本例不主动关机。"

msgid "IRQ wire: STP2 G0 -> Basic G26. G4 -> GND triggers input changes."
msgstr "GPIO 中断：STP2 G0 接 Basic G26，G4 为被测输入。A 清零，B 暂停，C 继续；显示中断次数和 G4 电平。"

msgid "IRQ wire: STP2 G0 -> Basic G26. Press STP2 button, not the Basic keys."
msgstr "模块按键中断：STP2 G0 接 Basic G26；按 STP2 自带按键产生事件。Basic A 清零，B 暂停，C 继续；分别显示单击与双击次数。"

msgid "Control the external STP2 LDO rail. B restores the original LDO state."
msgstr "LDO 电源：默认只读，按键不启用。源码 ALLOW_POWER_CHANGES=True 后，A 关闭，B 恢复启动状态，C 开启；Basic 必须独立供电。"

msgid "Manual feed test with a 10s timeout. When enabled: feed or stop before zero."
msgstr "看门狗：默认只读，按键不启用。源码 ALLOW_POWER_CHANGES=True 后，A 启动 10 秒看门狗，B 停止，C 手动喂狗；超时可能复位，Basic 独立供电。"

msgid "Commands affect the external STP2. No automatic reconnect after a command."
msgstr "系统命令：默认只读，按键不启用。源码 ALLOW_POWER_CHANGES=True 后，A 重启模块，B 关机，C 恢复默认配置；Basic 独立供电。普通示例不执行复位或恢复默认。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "Use M5Stack Basic with STP2 on I2C port A (SDA 21, SCL 22, 100 kHz). Each example includes a UiFlow2 project and its Python export. The examples use ticks_diff for a 100 ms refresh interval."
msgstr "使用 M5Stack Basic，STP2 接 I2C PORT.A（SDA 21、SCL 22、100 kHz）。每组提供 UiFlow2 图形化项目及 Python 导出代码，使用 ticks_diff 每 100 ms 刷新。"

msgid "GPIO input"
msgstr "GPIO 输入"

msgid "G4 is a pull-up input. Connect G4 to GND for Low (0), or release it for High (1)."
msgstr "G4 上拉输入，接地显示 Low (0)，松开显示 High (1)。"

msgid "GPIO output"
msgstr "GPIO 输出"

msgid "G3 is the output. Button A sets Low, B toggles the level, and C sets High. The display shows the commanded level and pin readback."
msgstr "G3 输出：A 置低、B 翻转、C 置高；分别显示设定值和引脚读回值。"

msgid "ADC input"
msgstr "ADC 输入"

msgid "Read raw ADC values from G1 and G2. Each value is in the range 0 to 4095."
msgstr "读取 G1、G2 的 ADC 原始值，范围为 0～4095。"

msgid "PWM output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

msgid "PWM0 uses G3 at 1 kHz. Button A decreases duty by 10 percentage points, B sets duty to zero, and C increases duty by 10 percentage points. Duty is limited to 0 to 100 percent."
msgstr "PWM0 使用 G3，频率 1 kHz。A 将占空比降低 10 个百分点，B 置零，C 提高 10 个百分点，范围 0～100%。"

msgid "GPIO interrupt"
msgstr "GPIO 中断"

msgid "Connect STP2 G0 to Basic G26 for IRQ. Connect G4 to GND and release it to generate input changes. Button A clears the count, B pauses IRQ handling, and C resumes it. The display shows the count and G4 level."
msgstr "IRQ 线连接 STP2 G0 与 Basic G26。G4 接地或松开产生输入变化；A 清零、B 暂停、C 继续，显示中断次数和 G4 电平。"

msgid "UiFlow2 Example"
msgstr "UiFlow2 示例"

msgid "MicroPython Example"
msgstr "MicroPython 示例"

msgid "Blockly screenshot pending."
msgstr "图形化积木截图待补充。"

msgid "Open the |basic_stp2_gpio_input_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |basic_stp2_gpio_input_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid "Open the |basic_stp2_gpio_output_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |basic_stp2_gpio_output_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid "Open the |basic_stp2_adc_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |basic_stp2_adc_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid "Open the |basic_stp2_pwm_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |basic_stp2_pwm_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid "Open the |basic_stp2_gpio_irq_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |basic_stp2_gpio_irq_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid "Power control"
msgstr "电源控制"

msgid "Open the |basic_stp2_power_config_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |basic_stp2_power_config_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid "Button A toggles LDO and button B toggles DCDC. The display and serial output show the enable states read from the module every 100 ms."
msgstr "按键 A 切换 LDO 开关，按键 B 切换 DCDC 开关。屏幕和串口每 100 ms 显示从模块读取的使能状态。"

msgid "NeoPixel control"
msgstr "NeoPixel 控制"

msgid "Open the |basic_stp2_neopixel_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |basic_stp2_neopixel_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid "Connect the LED data input to G0 and share GND. Button A cycles through red, green, blue and white; B decreases brightness by 10 percentage points and C increases it by 10. The example controls one LED, starting with red at 20 percent brightness."
msgstr "LED 数据输入连接 G0，并共地。按键 A 切换红、绿、蓝、白色，B 降低 10 个百分点亮度，C 提高 10 个百分点亮度。示例默认控制 1 颗 LED，初始为红色、20% 亮度。"

msgid "Timed power-on"
msgstr "定时开机"

msgid "Open the |basic_stp2_timer_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |basic_stp2_timer_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid "Button A toggles LDO output retention during shutdown (Off by default). Button B cycles the power-on delay through 5, 10 and 15 seconds (5 seconds by default). Button C (Shutdown) applies the setting, arms the power-on timer and immediately shuts down STP2. Buttons are locked until the countdown finishes."
msgstr "按键 A 切换关机期间的 LDO 输出保持，默认关闭。按键 B 循环选择 5、10、15 秒开机延时，默认 5 秒。按键 C（Shutdown）应用设置、启动定时开机并立即关闭 STP2。倒计时期间锁定按键。"

msgid "Keep Basic independently powered so it can display the countdown while STP2 is shut down."
msgstr "Basic 需独立供电，以便在 STP2 关机期间继续显示倒计时。"

msgid "The graphical example displays Timer elapsed when the countdown finishes; it does not verify the wake source."
msgstr "图形化示例在倒计时结束后显示 Timer elapsed，不核对唤醒来源。"

msgid "The Python example reads the wake source after the countdown and displays whether a timer wake was detected."
msgstr "Python 示例在倒计时结束后读取唤醒来源，显示是否检测到定时唤醒。"
